<Base lang="en" title="Privacy Policy — eDistrict UP Seva" description="The eDistrict UP Seva privacy policy — what information we collect, how cookies and advertising (Google AdSense) work, and how your information stays safe." path="/en/privacy-policy/" altPath="/privacy-policy/" updated="22 October 2026" datePublished="2026-10-22" dateModified="2026-10-22">
  <div class="content-col">
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <section class="box">
      <p>This privacy policy explains what information is collected when you visit <strong>eDistrict UP Seva</strong> (edistrictupseva.com) and how it is used. This is a content website: you do not need an account or registration to read any guide here.</p>

      <h3>Information we collect</h3>
      <p>There are <strong>no user accounts</strong> on this website, and we do <strong>not ask for or collect</strong> personal information such as your name, address, mobile number, Aadhaar number or bank details. There is no application form here, and no application-related data reaches us or is stored by us. If you contact us by email, your email address and message are used only to respond to you; they are never sold or shared with third parties.</p>

      <h3>Log files</h3>
      <p>Like almost every website, our servers keep standard technical logs — such as your IP address, browser type, the pages you viewed and the time of your visit. This information is not used to identify any individual; it helps us keep the site secure, investigate errors and understand overall traffic.</p>

      <h3>Cookies and analytics</h3>
      <p>We may use an analytics service to understand how the site is used — which pages are read most, and what kinds of devices visitors use. Such services place cookies in your browser and give us anonymous, aggregate statistics; they do not identify you personally. You can disable or delete cookies at any time in your browser settings, and doing so will not affect your ability to read our guides.</p>

      <h3>Advertising — Google AdSense and advertising cookies</h3>
      <p>This website may display advertisements served by third-party advertising services, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google's advertising cookies (such as the DoubleClick cookie) enable Google and its partners to show you personalised ads of this kind.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting Google's Ad Settings page.</li>
        <li>Details about third-party vendors' cookies, and how to opt out of them, are available in the respective vendors' privacy policies.</li>
        <li>Advertising servers and networks may use their own technologies (cookies, JavaScript, web beacons); we have no control over those activities.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Links to third-party websites</h3>
      <p>Our guides link to official government portals (such as edistrict.up.gov.in, esathi.up.gov.in and digilocker.gov.in) and other external websites. Once you follow an external link, that website's own privacy policy applies; we are not responsible for the content or practices of external sites. Please read a site's policy before submitting any personal information there.</p>

      <h3>Children's privacy</h3>
      <p>This website is intended for general readers and does not knowingly collect information from children under the age of 13. If you believe a child's information has reached us by mistake, contact us and we will remove it.</p>

      <h3>Changes to this policy</h3>
      <p>This privacy policy may be updated from time to time. When it changes, the revised policy will be published on this page and the "last updated" date above will be changed accordingly.</p>

      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>For any question about this policy, email us at <strong>contact@edistrictupseva.com</strong>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
